  "forAnalyst": "The search engine behind product listings and filters, on Elasticsearch 8.",
  "forArchitect": "A Search adapter: one dependency, no schema. Twelve settings — the largest configuration surface of any provider here — which is where analysers, certificates and connection details live.",
